<title>USA: Oakwood unit files $1bln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Oakwood unit files $1bln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakwood Mortgage Investors Inc, a financing unit of Oakwood Homes Corp, filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $1 billion in pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>The certificates represent ownership in a trust consisting of manufactured housing installment sales contracts and mortgages on one- to four-family properties.</p>
<p>The Greensboro, N.C. company did not name any underwriters in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
